---
title: SEQ-03 — Results, history, progress and streak (UC-12–UC-15)
config:
  theme: neutral
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Reader as Quran Reader
    participant App as Itqan App
    participant Progress as Progress Service
    participant DB as Database
    alt UC-12 View Session Results
        Reader->>App: Open ended or past session
        App->>Progress: getResultsAndHistory(Reader, Session ID)
        Progress->>DB: Read owned ended Session and Mistakes with Word and Rule
        DB-->>Progress: Surah, date, mode, end reason, score, mistakes
        Progress-->>App: Session results
        alt Counted Words are zero
            App-->>Reader: Show no score
        else Scored session
            App-->>Reader: Show Mastery Score and mistaken Words
        end
        opt Ended early or interrupted
            App-->>Reader: Explain score covers analysed Words only
        end
        opt No mistakes
            App-->>Reader: Show none detected
        end
    else UC-13 View Session History
        Reader->>App: Open History
        App->>Progress: getResultsAndHistory(Reader)
        Progress->>DB: Read Reader Sessions, newest first
        DB-->>Progress: Surah, date, mode and score per Session
        Progress-->>App: History list
        alt No Sessions
            App-->>Reader: Empty state with Start reciting action
        else Sessions exist
            App-->>Reader: List Sessions
            opt Reader opens a Session
                App->>Progress: getResultsAndHistory(Reader, Session ID)
                Progress->>DB: Read owned summary and Mistakes
                DB-->>Progress: Stored results
                Progress-->>App: Session results (UC-12)
            end
        end
    else UC-14 View User Progress
        Reader->>App: Open Progress
        App->>Progress: getMasteryAndStreak(Reader)
        Progress->>DB: Read Reader's ended scored Sessions
        DB-->>Progress: Scores and whole-Surah flags
        Progress->>Progress: Best score per Surah, full mastery if whole Surah and score at least 90 percent
        Progress->>Progress: Average of best scores for practised Surahs
        alt No scored Sessions
            Progress-->>App: Empty progress
        else Scored Sessions exist
            Progress-->>App: Full-mastery count, average and best per Surah
        end
        App-->>Reader: Show progress
    else UC-15 View Practice Streak
        Reader->>App: Open streak
        App->>Progress: getMasteryAndStreak(Reader, device-local calendar)
        Progress->>DB: Read ended scored Session dates
        DB-->>Progress: End instants and scores
        Progress->>Progress: Count consecutive local practice days to today or yesterday
        Progress-->>App: Streak days (0 if missed or none)
        App-->>Reader: Show streak
    end
    Note over Progress,DB: Progress values are derived, no required progress table or audio read
